## Durable test mission contract

Follow global `worker-test` / `e2e-cockpit` for the receipt and question/ACK flow.
FIFO plus tick dispatches work at sequence 0 without heartbeat; run the exact
`accept-dispatch` receipt, start only on `accepted` / `start_work=true`
(sequence 1), then `heartbeat` running sequence 2. Duplicate is not a test rerun.
`ask` / `access-prompt` use private typed body refs; `pending` / `read-question`
return durable mission-status JSON. Only explicit human replies; `hold --answers`
does not approve. Inspect `status.pending_commands` / `command-status`;
accepted-worker cancel/replace requires accepted then applied ACK with matching
digest and typed `--result` after safely stopping. Reuse IDs/digests, journal no
secrets, and keep lifecycle separate from pane diagnosis. No raw `send`/`nudge`
mission, approval or cancel shortcuts.
